# Phase — Project Intelligence

## Product
Visual RSI regime EA only — no trading.

## Regime
- Lookback 60: bull = RSI in [35,80], bear = RSI in [20,65]
- Higher score wins; tie holds previous; both < 70% → Neutral
- History: rolling score over 500 bars → vertical strips

## Drawing
- Prefix `PH_`
- Bg: OBJ_RECTANGLE_LABEL fullscreen dark green/red
- Boxes: body only (open/close), bull down→up green, bear up→down red

## Companion
`Indicators/Phase_RSI.mq5` — RSI(10), levels 20/35/40/60/65/80, zone fills

## Docs
Phase_PRD.md + memory-bank/ — update on significant changes
